      American Society of Animal Science.
FAU - Kavlak, Alper T
AU  - Kavlak AT
AUID- ORCID: 0000-0001-6829-4242
AD  - Department of Agricultural Sciences, University of Helsinki, Helsinki 00014,
      Finland.
FAU - Uimari, Pekka
AU  - Uimari P
AD  - Department of Agricultural Sciences, University of Helsinki, Helsinki 00014,
      Finland.
LA  - eng
